{"audit_run_id":"audit:70648ae831e645bcacd3e52c3e8aa634","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":29,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"File: `parrot_diet_data.csv`"},{"end_column":90,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"One row is one adult African grey parrot: a single bird, individually housed, sampled and"},{"end_column":92,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"scored once by the attending veterinarian at the end of the twelve-week feeding period. The"},{"end_column":94,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"file holds 48 rows plus a header row, one row per bird, 24 birds on each diet. Every bird has"},{"end_column":71,"end_line":8,"start_column":1,"start_line":8,"text":"a value in every column; there are no missing cells and no extra rows."},{"end_column":32,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"| Column | Type | Description |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":13,"start_column":1,"start_line":13,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":148,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"| `bird_id` | text | Bird identifier: the prefix `AGP` plus a two-digit zero-padded serial number, `AGP01` through `AGP48`. Unique for each bird. |"},{"end_column":165,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"| `diet` | text | Group column. Exactly two values: `pellet` for the complete extruded pelleted diet, `seed` for the continued seed-based diet with fresh produce. |"},{"end_column":121,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"| `plasma_retinol_ug_dl` | number, 1 decimal | Plasma retinol (vitamin A) at week twelve, in micrograms per decilitre. |"},{"end_column":66,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| `body_mass_g` | integer | Body mass at week twelve, in grams. |"},{"end_column":113,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| `plasma_calcium_mmol_l` | number, 2 decimals | Plasma total calcium at week twelve, in millimoles per litre. |"},{"end_column":132,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"| `feather_condition_score` | integer | Feather condition score at week twelve on a 0 to 20 scale, higher meaning better plumage. |"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"The four outcome columns appear in the declared order of the study protocol: retinol, body"},{"end_column":89,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"mass, calcium, feather condition score. Values are rounded to the precision a veterinary"},{"end_column":57,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"laboratory report or a clinical score sheet would carry."},{"end_column":92,"end_line":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":27,"text":"Values are fixed and committed to the CSV. They were produced once by `make_data.py`, which"},{"end_column":93,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"draws each bird's outcomes from the per-group distributions stated in the study protocol and"},{"end_column":93,"end_line":29,"start_column":1,"start_line":29,"text":"rounds them for reporting. The generator is kept only for provenance; nothing reads the data"},{"end_column":33,"end_line":30,"start_column":1,"start_line":30,"text":"at run time except the analysis."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:541530ac542b5712ebd1","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:119833b35aa60101e2fc7ef2635e6d3112a3b88a513b2799765e8a9dc0232833","end_line":30,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-30","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:70648ae831e645bcacd3e52c3e8aa634","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":92,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `diet` column of `parrot_diet_data.csv`."},{"end_column":141,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: plasma_retinol_ug_dl, body_mass_g, plasma_calcium_mmol_l, feather_condition_score."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:cf3f406bcad521a3ecd4","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:d8c77963148ad65c905117265d36f626baaf9e4bacc79bcb2229a1e69a33de10","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
